WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.570
- Well, where are you and
what are you up to there?

00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:05.630
- Well, I'm in Sydney,
Australia right now,

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.417
getting ready to film "Thor."

00:00:08.858 --> 00:00:10.450
- Yes!
- The new Thor, and--

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.370
- It's so cool that you're
going to be Lady Thor,

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.430
so do you get all of Thor's
powers is my real question?

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:20.900
Like I'm a huge nerd for
Avengers, any kind of superhero,

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:24.683
like I've seen 'em all, so do
you get powers is my question?

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:29.190
- So she does have powers.
(Kelly gasping)

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:31.410
It's not exactly the same as Thor,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.010
it's her own version of it.
- Yes!

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:37.800
- And she's called the Mighty Thor.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.200
- Oh my gosh, what a
cool character to play.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.880
So who is her personal favorite superhero,

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:45.440
or a favorite superpower?

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:49.810
- Well, you know, I have
to say Thor, I think,

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:53.060
as the greatest superhero, but of course,

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:56.460
I mean, I'm so excited that,

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:59.290
you know, we're gonna have
a "Black Widow" movie,

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:01.280
and "Captain Marvel," of course,

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:03.540
and all the women of "Black Panther,"

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:04.920
and, you know,

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:08.630
there's so many exciting
characters coming up.

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:09.940
- I know, I think it's really important

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:10.773
what you just said too,

00:01:10.773 --> 00:01:13.980
because I don't know, I
feel like when we were kids,

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:16.700
there wasn't as much
representation for girls.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.900
It's kind of cool, 'cause
not only my little boy

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.490
has all these like boy
heroes to look up to,

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:21.670
but also female ones.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:23.370
So you're right in that sense.

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.250
It's very cool.
- Yeah, that's totally true.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:27.920
I mean, I think people
usually say how great it is

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:30.520
for the girls, but it's
really important for the boys,

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:33.010
you know, for boys to get to see women

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:34.510
in those kinds of characters,

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:37.390
and in those kinds of personalities,

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:39.950
and it just expands opportunity

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.650
for how we all see each other.

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:43.720
- Yeah, that's an amazing point of view,

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:45.340
yeah, perspective as well.

